"
===================
Fuel Fault Recovery
===================
Raises a fuel leak fault and checks the system recovers.

Requirements
------------
1. :req:`VMCFUE00004`
2. :req:`VMCFUE00007`
"

(Precondition "Demo running in normal mode"
  (demo-in-mode? :normal)
  :heal (start-demo :normal))

"
Steps
-----
"

(raise-fault :fuel-leak)
(fault-active? :fuel-leak)
(clear-faults)
(no-faults?)
